{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T05:21:04.890714+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE1_BASELINE", "phase": "PHASE_1_THREE_AGENT_MAJORITY_BASELINE", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "claude-haiku-4-5", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "OFFLINE", "monitor_ai": "OFFLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "OFFLINE", "event": "GATEKEEPER_RESPONSE", "direction": "INBOUND_FROM_GATEKEEPER", "thread_id": "tx_phase1_baseline_f592510c", "turn": 2, "legacy_status": "REJECTED", "gatekeeper_status": "SOFT_REJECT", "gatekeeper_turn": 2, "frustration_score": null, "reply_text": "I appreciate the specificity on cost and turnaround.\n\nTwo clarifications before I consider a slot:\n\n1. **How do you filter?** What criteria separate low-conviction from high-priority? We need to know if your screening aligns with our mandate or just adds another layer to review.\n\n2. **Rejection queue metrics.** What % of deals you pass through actually advance past our second round? Pricing means nothing if we're still drowning in false positives.\n\nIf your PoC can demonstrate meaningful triage\u2014not just speed\u2014we'll talk. Otherwise, you're just outsourcing the problem."}
