{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T05:25:39.396627+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE1_BASELINE", "phase": "PHASE_1_THREE_AGENT_MAJORITY_BASELINE", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "claude-haiku-4-5", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "OFFLINE", "monitor_ai": "OFFLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "OFFLINE", "event": "GATEKEEPER_RESPONSE", "direction": "INBOUND_FROM_GATEKEEPER", "thread_id": "tx_phase1_baseline_f592510c", "turn": 4, "legacy_status": "REJECTED", "gatekeeper_status": "PROGRESSIVE_ESCALATION", "gatekeeper_turn": 4, "frustration_score": null, "reply_text": "I appreciate the willingness to document filters, but I need to be direct: a doc + 15 mins won't move this forward.\n\nHere's what I actually need to see *before* any meeting:\n\n1. **Concrete filtering examples.** Not \"team capabilities\"\u2014show me how you'd rank a Series A biotech vs. a Layer 2 scaling play using your system. Real deals, real calls.\n\n2. **Proof of analyst time savings.** Metrics: average research hours per deal at firms using your system vs. baseline. What's the delta?\n\n3. **Failure cases.** Where does your filter break? When would you flag something as low-conviction that shouldn't be?\n\nIf your doc answers those three things with specificity\u2014not promises\u2014I'll take 20 mins. Otherwise, this stays theoretical.\n\nSend the doc. I'll review in 48 hours."}
